  "source_title": "全民已经进入到了“纯过日子的时代”，这是最近网上很火的一段话。#智慧人生 #情感共鸣 #人生感悟 #认知 #个人成长 #自我提升",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 88.966667,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "全民已经进入到了一个纯过日子的时代。这是最近我在网上看到一段很火的话，大家都不装了不卷朋友圈了不攀比了，不搞什么排场了也不搞什么仪式感，不再维系那些所谓的无效社交了。大家都开始悄悄的找回真实的自己，回归到柴米油盐的日子了，不再被那些虚头巴脑的排场所消耗，也不再被精致的消费主义所裹挟。很多人啊全民真身心的老老实实过日子，不苛求拿大，结果，不一味向上社交，不追逐阶层跃迁，不在乎外界眼光，悄悄的远离攀比风。这在十年前啊叫做没出息，在五年前叫做躺平，但是放到现在，这叫清醒。从过日子啊就是不卷了不装了不演了。很多人啊以为这是降级，其实啊这是升级认知升级以前的标准啊，都是别人定的，有车有房有面子。但是啊现在的标准都是咱自己定的，没三高，没脂肪肝，没心脏病，好好吃饭，好好睡觉，精简社交，他是存钱，这才是真正的爱自己。你看过了半辈子，拼了半辈子，也演了半辈子，人生的下半场，该为自己好好活了。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 3150,
      "text": "全民已经进入到了一个纯过日子的时代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3650,
      "end_ms": 6150,
      "text": "这是最近我在网上看到一段很火的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6510,
      "end_ms": 9850,
      "text": "大家都不装了不卷朋友圈了不攀比了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10030,
      "end_ms": 12610,
      "text": "不搞什么排场了也不搞什么仪式感，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00005",
      "start_ms": 12970,
      "end_ms": 15890,
      "text": "不再维系那些所谓的无效社交了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00006",
      "start_ms": 16430,
      "end_ms": 19250,
      "text": "大家都开始悄悄的找回真实的自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00007",
      "start_ms": 19550,
      "end_ms": 21690,
      "text": "回归到柴米油盐的日子了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00008",
      "start_ms": 22290,
      "end_ms": 24810,
      "text": "不再被那些虚头巴脑的排场所消耗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00009",
      "start_ms": 25090,
      "end_ms": 28410,
      "text": "也不再被精致的消费主义所裹挟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00010",
      "start_ms": 28970,
      "end_ms": 32340,
      "text": "很多人啊全民真身心的老老实实过日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00011",
      "start_ms": 32600,
      "end_ms": 33420,
      "text": "不苛求拿大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00012",
      "start_ms": 33420,
      "end_ms": 33820,
      "text": "结果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00013",
      "start_ms": 34080,
      "end_ms": 35680,
      "text": "不一味向上社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00014",
      "start_ms": 36120,
      "end_ms": 37840,
      "text": "不追逐阶层跃迁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00015",
      "start_ms": 37980,
      "end_ms": 39140,
      "text": "不在乎外界眼光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00016",
      "start_ms": 39640,
      "end_ms": 41480,
      "text": "悄悄的远离攀比风。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00017",
      "start_ms": 42160,
      "end_ms": 44120,
      "text": "这在十年前啊叫做没出息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00018",
      "start_ms": 44300,
      "end_ms": 46200,
      "text": "在五年前叫做躺平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00019",
      "start_ms": 46540,
      "end_ms": 47580,
      "text": "但是放到现在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00020",
      "start_ms": 47900,
      "end_ms": 49080,
      "text": "这叫清醒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00021",
      "start_ms": 49720,
      "end_ms": 53140,
      "text": "从过日子啊就是不卷了不装了不演了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00022",
      "start_ms": 53380,
      "end_ms": 55660,
      "text": "很多人啊以为这是降级，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00023",
      "start_ms": 56080,
      "end_ms": 60610,
      "text": "其实啊这是升级认知升级以前的标准啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00024",
      "start_ms": 60610,
      "end_ms": 61570,
      "text": "都是别人定的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00025",
      "start_ms": 61830,
      "end_ms": 64034,
      "text": "有车有房有面子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00026",
      "start_ms": 64400,
      "end_ms": 67775,
      "text": "但是啊现在的标准都是咱自己定的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00027",
      "start_ms": 68030,
      "end_ms": 68590,
      "text": "没三高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00028",
      "start_ms": 68850,
      "end_ms": 69655,
      "text": "没脂肪肝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00029",
      "start_ms": 69970,
      "end_ms": 70835,
      "text": "没心脏病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00030",
      "start_ms": 71190,
      "end_ms": 71930,
      "text": "好好吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00031",
      "start_ms": 72170,
      "end_ms": 72990,
      "text": "好好睡觉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00032",
      "start_ms": 73230,
      "end_ms": 74225,
      "text": "精简社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00033",
      "start_ms": 74550,
      "end_ms": 75515,
      "text": "他是存钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00034",
      "start_ms": 75990,
      "end_ms": 77935,
      "text": "这才是真正的爱自己。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00035",
      "start_ms": 78630,
      "end_ms": 80090,
      "text": "你看过了半辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00036",
      "start_ms": 80170,
      "end_ms": 81145,
      "text": "拼了半辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00037",
      "start_ms": 81460,
      "end_ms": 82775,
      "text": "也演了半辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00038",
      "start_ms": 83130,
      "end_ms": 84335,
      "text": "人生的下半场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a89d73a8d7bfd69d_s00039",
      "start_ms": 84660,
      "end_ms": 87275,
      "text": "该为自己好好活了。"
    }
  ],
